There's been a few questions about why the insert is catching so many pokemon. Quite simply, it's because he's a big pokemon fan that has ended up in the pokemon world. People talking about Rattata not being viable or anything like that, are missing the entire point. It's a freaking pokemon. Of course if I ended up there I'd grab as many as I could.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {\page } {\s1 \afs32
