Right, I'm gonna address something that's bothered quite a few with this here and now. The young age. The protagonist isn't actual a 12 year old, just in a 12 year old body. The reason why this is, is because this story was originally a challenge prompt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The challenge behind it was, aging up the usual age trainers started at, and having an insert character appear younger, and using meta knowledge to appear as a prodigy. That is the reason why I can't just go back and change the age, despite how much it bothers me as well. The entire premise of the story, functions on the fact that he is younger than them. So, if you can't deal with that, you should stop reading, because it's not changing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {\page } {\s1 \afs32
{\b
