Here we are with another chapter. And I've also uplaoded two more stories, A Berserk Heart A Fate Grand Order story and One Piece:Rise a One Piece story. I'll link them in the comments if you wanna check them out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {\page } {\s1 \afs32
