Welp, this might be my last post ever. Grandad went into hospital last night with covid, and I spent the night vomitting constantly. Due to busy circumstances, I've only got the 1 vaccine shot atm, so I might not make it. Heading to get tested right now, but it's pretty much a foregone conclusion innit? Do not weep for me lads, for my penis is huge even in death.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {\page } {\s1 \afs32
