82: Chapter 82\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An hour later, I lay in my bed staring up into a ceiling, a contemplative frown on my face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both of us, Hilda and I, had messed around for a bit longer than intended, and she left only ten minutes ago in a rush. Not that I'm complaining, beyond the big blue obvious of course, I'd had extra time to make my mark on that lovely neck of hers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rawr, I'm a vampire baby!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was weird, I'd been planning on leaving her behind myself from the very beginning after Pidgeotto evolved into Pidgeot, but here I am, her having left of her own accord, freeing up my plans massively without anyone keeping an eye on me\u8230?yet, I'm kind of sad she'd left.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And not just because she's hotter than the surface of the sun itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I guess I'll miss her company. Hilda was pretty useful to have around, she helped fill in some gaps in my knowledge and give me more of a view into the common sense of this world, and her banter was great, amazing even, she meshed with me pretty well, she knew not to take my jokes seriously and didn't get all affronted at every little thing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A rare gem of a lady.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pokegirls are just built different man.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, enough of this." I slapped my cheeks and pushed myself up out of the bed. I quickly grabbed a pair socks, slipping them on and then my shoes and grabbed the belt with my pokeballs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was still early, and I'm gonna be getting right into some training this morning as usual, so I didn't bother with a shirt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Going by prior experience, not many would be up at this time beyond Nurse Joy, and she'd had way more of a look at me, beyond being simple shirtless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She got a good look at me, full on au naturale.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As I was making my way out of the room, I paused at the mirror on the wall. I wanted to get a look at my back. At one point, when I'd been on top of Hilda last night, she'd dug her nails into my back and scratched me up something fierce.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Note: when she loses control enough to scratch up your back while screaming and moaning, you know you're doing a good job. Keep it up lads!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I turned and angled myself so I could get a look at the scratch marks, before frowning, "\u8230?That's odd." I muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The long bloody red claw marks were still there, as I expected. But, they were faint, and didn't look scabbed over. Which is very weird because I'd felt the scabbing start up before I went to sleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They're healing pretty damn quickly. This is something I'd expect like a week later, not just a night.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Well, whatever. I've not really been injured since I got here, so it's probably just something to do with this world itself rather than anything special.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a shrug, I continued on my way, stepping out of my room, locking the door behind me and heading downstairs to find a training room.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I gave Nurse Joy whom I passed by a wink, and had to withhold a laugh when her face flushed a deep red.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bow chika wow wow!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
________________________________________\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pidgeot was the eye of all of my pokemon when I brought them all out. His sheer size in his newly evolved form and the power he radiated drew eyes to him like a Venomoth to a flame.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But, it wasn't just awe they felt upon seeing his new strength. As a Pidgeotto, he was already the strongest among all of my pokemon, with a sizeable lead over the others, now, as a Pidgeot, the gulf between them had only grown larger.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
My pokemon trained hard, every damn day, but they threw themselves into the training today with a zeal that made their previous efforts seem like childs play in comparison.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially Fearow and Zubat. They challenged Pidgeot to a battle, and even two on one, Pidgeot defeated them with ease. Even Fearow's powerful hyper beam attack, never managed to do much when Pidgeot blocked it with Steel Wing and shrugged off the damage. Faster, stronger, more durable, Fearow and Zubat together, just couldn't compare to Pidgeot's absurd new strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Honestly, even I was surprised by it. I knew he'd become even stronger when evolving\u8230?but not this much.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was visibly apparent how frustrating it was to the duo facing Pidgeot, with how much stronger he was then them. Zubat was the first to go down and hard, with a single Wing Attack after Pidgeot stopped playing around a bit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And he would have stayed down, if not for the moment he erupted into bright light and grew massively before my eyes. A massive Golbat took to the air, and fucking hell was Golbat big, way bigger than I thought they were, of size with Fearow even and Fearow was actually quite a bit bigger than the average of his species.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If it weren't for how awkward Golbat's body was, I could totally fly on his back as well easily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Not that the new evolution amounted to much, not even when he pulled out a new attack learned from evolving in the form of a massive red gale of blistering heat. Pidgeot bullied the Heat Wave attack out of existence with a mere Gust.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And then Golbat hit the ground after Pidgeot blitzed him faster than he could react with Agility and then Quick Attack, punishing him with a Steel Wing, and then Fearow followed to the ground not long later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pidgeot proved his dominance over the rest of them with that. After all, out of the current party I have with me, Fearow was one of the strongest, alongside Shiftry, the ones only lagging a bit behind Pidgeotto before he became Pidgeot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not that they were down for long, not with the combined healing prowess of Chansey, Clefable and Milotic together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
