91: Chapter 91\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Get ready, it's not done yet." I cautioned Fearow, the giant bird giving me a single nod and his keen eyes watching the water surface for movement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Dragonite\u8230?It's familiar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The angry look, the sudden attacks, both Ice Beam and Thunderpunch, I'm sure I've saw it before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If I'm not wrong, it answers a lot of questions on where that particular Dragonite even came from.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The water surface exploded in a massive geyser and from it, erupted a huge serpentine dragon of glowing blue, roaring energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dragon Rush!" I gasped, "Ascend up!" I quickly ordered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Quickly, Fearow shot up higher into the air, and I had to force myself not to panic. I trust Fearow, but holy fucking fuck are we high in the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fearow was faster than the attack, and we gained distance from it as we went up, giving us time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Exactly what I wanted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Forcing myself not to tremble I grit my teeth, "Hyper Beam, blow it outta the air!" I commanded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fearow's long beak snapped open, a familiar sphere of inky black energy swirling and compressing into existence, the distance we got from ascending, giving him well enough time to charge it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, just as Dragonite encased by the power of Dragon Rush was a mere fifty or so feet away from us, a mere second at most from reaching us-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fearow spread his wings wide to brace himself and unleashed his attack straight down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A large and powerful black beam of pure destruction exploded down out of his mouth and slammed straight into the Dragon Rush attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive sonic boom erupted as the attacks clashed, blowing away all the rain for hundreds of feet, near creating a new eye in the storm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"DROOOOOOOOOOOO!" I heard a furious howl even over the roars of the clashing energy, serpentine blue energy dragon pushing against the black beam of power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A single foot, then a second, and suddenly it was tearing up through the Hyper Beam attack, gaining easily a good thirty feet-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before losing momentum, the beam of power swelling as Fearow fed more energy into it and tore straight through the Dragon Rush.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For a split moment I saw Dragonite as the attack was torn away, its furious looking eyes widening in shock before the Hyper Beam slammed straight into it head on and carried it back down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Follow it!" I barked quickly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Dragonite wouldn't go down this easily!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite my orders, Fearow didn't move much for a small bit, panting deeply. It wasn't that long though-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, one of the first things I'd done upon teaching Fearow Hyper Beam, was have him spam it constantly during training to get him used to it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It's his strongest attack by far and I want him to be able to charge it rapidly and fire it on the fly without having to wait long to recharge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
We found a way of using it as well that was quite interesting, quicker, but weaker, but that didn't matter right now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fearow moved once he recovered just a second or two later, quickly scything down through the air towards where the Hyper Beam carried Dragonite down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had already faded away and the large yellow scaled dragon was currently free falling through the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The momentum behind it from Hyper Beam was pretty stellar, but still not fast enough to escape Fearow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
We caught up to it rapidly, and I noted, its eyes were shut.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Had it fallen unconscious al-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite's eyes snapped open\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fearow spun mid-air, swerving around a sudden large gout of flame that erupted from its throat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nice try!" I laughed, "Throat Chop!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From swerving around the gout of flames, we quickly got behind Dragonite, and now, before it could swivel around fully to attack once again, Fearow's wings sparked and exploded with dark power, wings glowing ominously and slammed one of his wings into the back of Dragonite's neck.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite gagged and got stunned, freezing up from the blow and falling limply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I don't think that's enough for a Dragonite though.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Razor Wind!" I followed up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The colours of his wings shifted in vibrancy to a bright brilliant and gleaming white a split moment later and Fearow beat his wings hard and rapidly, unleashing a barrage of dozens of condensed wind blades.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite of course, couldn't dodge or block and was caught easily by the barrage of attacks slicing into its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And moments later, the large dragon pokemon slammed into the water surface, a much smaller geyser splashing up over its body in comparison to the one that erupted from the Dragon Rush a minute ago.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fearow levelled out quickly above the water, ready and waiting to react, dodge or attack, either or really.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But, there was no need.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A second later, Dragonite surface in the water, belly up and floating there in the roiling waves, unconscious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive grin spread across my face, "Really wasn't expecting this." I laughed, reaching into my pocket and pulling out a shrunken pokeball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I enlarged it and had Fearow take me down just low enough so I could reach over and tap the pokeball to Dragonite's body. The ball snapped open and a beam of red shot out, encasing Dragonite's body, before slurping it up like a wet noddle and closing quickly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It took in my hand for all of a second, before letting loose a ping of success, notifying me of my capture of Dragonite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And good thing I'd sent half my team back to the Pokemon Centre in Viridian City so he didn't get sent off there.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I'll need to discipline this guy a but to get him obedient, "Can't be that hard considering that clown Iris did it." I snorted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I'm almost certain after all, that this Dragonite is the one that Iris later caught, and she was a completely trashy and incompetent loser, nothing at all like her based manga and game self. Now that was a woman!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not that 'you're such a kid' trollop.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
