138: Chapter 138\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hydreigon, Dragon Pulse!" Lance decided to start things off with this round. He wanted to push and see more of Jord and his pokemons abilities when backed into a corner.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A savage howl was released from Hydreigon's trio of heads, multicoloured light exploding into existence in his trio of maws, before unleashing a three piece set of gargantuan multi-coloured beams of pure destruction that formed into a trio of titanic roaring dragon maws of pure power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One on the right, one on the left.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And one straight down the middle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And with their sheer size and speed, it cut off any avenue for Charizard to escape between them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They hit nothing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When the trio of monolithic beams of power passed by and harmless flew off into the sky in the distance with nothing to show for it, it was to reveal a large hole in the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Dig, huh?' Lance grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A classic.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though impressive it could find the time and room to dig such a hole in the face of Hydreigon's attacks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And going by what he'd seen of Jord so far-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"LR, protect, M, hydro hump." Lance ordered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The right and left heads of Hydreigon roared, both conjuring a double layered green spherical barrier around his body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just in time for the ground beneath Hydreigon to buckle and burst open and a familiar orange scaled winged beast to shoot forth, both arms clad in claws of pure draconic energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And a familiar aura of power suffusing around Charizard's body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'He used Dragon Dance to enhance Charizard's speed and strength to dig faster.' Lance nodded approvingly as the twin Dragon Claw attacked smashed into Hydreigon's twin protect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A sound like a gong being struck rung out, and the first barrier rippled noticeably under the blow, but that was all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Hydreigon was already prepared to counter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The twin barriers dropped and Hydreigon's main head unleashed a massive spiralling gout of pressurized water point blank at the Charizard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only to miss\u8230?as Charizard went limp and rolled downwards back into the hole it had previously made.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Swords Dance, then again!" Jord shouted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A moment later, Charizard burst back out of the hole, the green aura of Dragon Dance around its body, being infused with a crackling red piercing through it almost like electricity, arms infused once more with twin Dragon Claw attacks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Enhancing the attack even further huh?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Surf." Lance commanded simply. The tactic to dodge back into the dig hole was good for sure, but what would he do in the face of an attack so wide and encompassing such a thing wasn't viable?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What would he do in the face of an attack like that, three times over?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A trio of glittering blue spheres of hydro energy formed in Hydreigon's three mouths, before erupting and bursting forth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A trio of titanic waves, one alone enough to create a fifty feet high and fifty feet wide tsunami, formed into one monstrous wave of all encompassing crushing water.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"BLA-"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He heard Jord begin to shout, before it was drowned out by the roaring monstrous wave, blotting him and Charizard both from sight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance felt the ground shake ominously beneath him as if an earthquake had begun and sweat began to form on his brow as a sudden, roaring heat made itself known.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bright orange light flashed, shimmering up through the wave before a massive explosion erupted and blew the entirety of the massive wave of water away.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance blinked as the entirety of the massively cratered battlefield came back into view.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steam sizzled from the battlefield into the air, and he found the Charizard down on one knee, one hand clenched into a fist and buried deep in the battlefield itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh-ho?" Lance's lips curved into a grin, "Blast Burn huh, that's really impressive."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not only was it impressive that Jord's Charizard was already capable of using the penultimate fire type attack, but that quick thinking to use it to blow away the convergent trio of surf attacks and actually have the power capable of doing so.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
it was all just impressive, very very impressive.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though, looking at the Charizard, the aura of dragon dance and swords dance now gone, and noticeably exhausted, it did not come without a price.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite its impressive size, that Charizard was still so very young, just like its trainer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He'd like to see what more it was capable of, but now wasn't the time to give them the chance to recover, it was the time to push them further and back them even further into a corner and see how they replied.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Charge Beam, go." Lance ordered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydreigon wasted not a single moment, trio of maws opening and three crackling bright yellow spheres forming in them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before unleashing them in a trio of massive yellow electrical beams that converged into one titanic beam of pure electrical power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ground it!" Jord shouted over the roaring beam of yellow power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance watched in interest as the exhausted Charizard forced itself up, claws gleaming silver alongside its tail and thrust both arms out to catch the electrical beam head on, at the same time it thrust its tail down into the ground itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And he still watched as the beam of power slammed into Charizard, and did absolutely nothing, it barely even winced as the attack washed over it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'That's second time he's done that this battle.' Lance blinked. Specifically to electric attacks too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He wondered how that worked?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He put it out of mind though as he noticed an electrical current form of Hydreigon's body. Perfect, he'd gotten the power boost that Charge Beam could provide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Twice by his reckoning going by how thick the voltage was.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Charge Beam was perfect for Hydreigon. Each usage had a rather large chance for temporarily enhancing the users power. And Hydreigon could fire three at once, giving three chances at once for the boost.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now then, what would Jord and Charizard do now? Four times now he and his Charizard had managed to overcome attacks that should he ended the battle right then and there.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What would they do now in the face of Hydreigon with his power boosted twice over from Charge Beam?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Left, shock wave. Right, Surf. Main, Draco Meteor." Lance grinned as he upped the ante.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
