154: Chapter 154\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Chloe's mouth dropped low as she gaped at me, "\u8230?Over a hundred?" she mouthed, "I don't think dad even has that many pokemon from his sponsored trainers living at his lab."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gotta catch em' all baby." I winked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Considering how much of a playboy you are, I don't think you'll have a problem catching them all in the future." she deadpanned back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Chloe of the sarcasm strikes back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
My eyebrows rose, "Not too much of a playboy for you to give your virginity to though." I replied.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I mean, so far as I'd learned through my journey, sex here was pretty liberal between trainers. Encouraged even.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The League after all, did want to increase the human population while at the same time having a surplus of trainers to own pokemon. What better way to do that than to have unsupervised teenage trainers travelling the world as a right of passage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Chloe wasn't a trainer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, with the way you spoke I figured you had a good idea of what you were doing and I thought it would make for a fun first time instead of an awkward one," Chloe replied, looking away as she scratched her cheek with a finger, "Plus\u8230?you know, you're cute and famous and have nice muscles. On top of that you were offering a path I could think on that I've been in a rut over for ages and I just kinda liked the energy you gave off."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So it was less rizz and more just ticking boxes for her and pragmatism? Damn, I completely read her wrong. Even though she was totally embarrassed and out of her element at first, she stuck it through.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Respect Chloe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
My opinion of her totally rose just now. I can totally get behind that. Well, I mean, I've already got behind her. But semantics!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I can respect that," I grinned, and crossed my arms, "So have you picked then? Cheerleader or wanna work for me?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Technically I'd be working for you either way," Chloe grinned back at me faintly as she turned back to face me, "\u8230?But honestly I'm still not sure. This is like a decision of something I want to do for the rest of my life right? So I need to put real thought into it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Oh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She's not wrong, but at the same time, she's not really right either. "You know you could just work for me for a set period of time to earn enough money then stop and do whatever catches your fancy right?" I pointed out, "I mean, beyond everything else and tradition, I'd recommend something pokemon focused simply because of the benefits you get from being a trainer, like better interest rates from banks and the like."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Chloe took in my words for a moment, before tilting her head to the side a bit and humming, "\u8230?Huh, I actually hadn't thought of it like that before." she admitted, "That's not a bad idea either. At least I wouldn't be wasting any time that way. Still, I need to think a little on it just to be sure."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fair enough," I agreed, "Still, you should tell me your measurements in advance just in case you chose that cheerleader option so I can get good uniform made for you." I laughed, giving her body that I'd thoroughly enjoyed for the past few hours a leering once over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll think about it if I actually choose that option," Chloe rolled her eyes, "I'm actually not all that coordinated, I've never been much into sports so being a cheerleading would be pretty disappointing for you I think."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nah, you bounce pretty damn well from my experience." I laughed back, my eyes lingering on her large breasts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She snorted and shook her head, "\u8230?Yeah, I'm sure I do," she replied before pushing herself up off the bed, "Now I'm gonna go take a shower and get dressed before you make me spend another hour bouncing around."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We'll save that for later then." I replied as she walked passed me and made her way into the room provided bathroom.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the door clicked shut behind her and the sound of the shower running started up a second later, a thought occurred.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?I actually technically have a hundred and nineteen pokemon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Or I will have.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Once you hatch, right little buddy?" I asked the egg I pulled out of my backpack sitting on the floor to check it over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It looked just the same as when I got it. I wonder when it'll hatch? Hopefully some time soon, but it could take a while. Ash wouldn't pick Togepi's egg up for another few months after all in the other worlds timeline.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm gonna make you into a tiny murder machine, yes I am." I cooed at the egg, stroking it it gently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And suddenly-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bright white light shone from the egg, illuminating the entirety of the room and near god damn blinding me. I looked away with a hiss for a moment, blinking spots from my eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before looking back through now narrowed eyes and watched in awe as the large egg in my hand morphed and changed. It shrunk a bit in size, becoming slimmer, but the shape didn't change all that much. Tiny little arms and feet formed, and the top of the egg sunk in, becoming a row of little spiky hills.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And then the light receded and I was greeted by a cute chirpy voice, "Togepri!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The tiny little Togepi in my hand stared up at me with a beaming little innocent smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Awe filled me.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Life had just been born in the palm of my hands.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Literally!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Heya tiny murder machine, welcome to the world," I cooed at it and gently reached over with my other hand to rub it gently across the head, "You can call me big papa ding dong Jord."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
