169: Chapter 168\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Changed the cover art.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
___________________________\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Blast\u8230?" Blastoise sighed in resignation as he appeared before me and beheld his towering opponent. The behemoth of a Tyranitar had a good five feet on him in height.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tyranitar on the other hand smirked cockily and pointed one massive green clawed hand towards Blastoise. A spiral of purple and black power erupted into existence, a dark pulse attack roaring towards Blastoise in the blink of an eye.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I didn't need to say or command anything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise immediately retreated into his shell, which then gleamed as Withdraw came into effect. The Dark Pulse slammed into his shell-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And bounced off, ricocheting back towards the Tyranitar who didn't blink an eye and back handed the spiralling beam of black and purple casually into the sky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rapid Spin." I commanded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise's shell made a great impression of a beyblade - the new and improved Draciel - as his shell began to rotate at rapid speeds and he zipped through the air like an artillery shell towards the behemoth of a Tyranitar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clawed hands caught Blastoise mid-air, his shell grinding against Tyranitar's hands. Tyranitar was pushed back a good four or five metres before it dug its clawed feet into the ground and stopped itself from behind pushed back, and slammed Blastoise into the ground, its mouth opening and a familiar crackling dark sphere of powering humming into existence within its maw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was fine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hydro Pump!" I shouted next.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a grunt, Blastoise appeared from his shell on all fours, head level with Tyranitar's stomach as he was held down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As were his massive shoulder cannons that appeared out of his shell as well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Massive twin jets of finely compressed water cannons erupted from the shoulder cannons, each capable of crumpling a double decker bus in an instant and slammed into Tyranitar's stomach with bone crunching force.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Tyranitar roared in pain as its armoured stomach was tore into by the massive water jets and it was forced to let go as it was sent flying back through the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Casual look on its face gone, Tyranitar directed an angered howl and didn't stop its attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It unleashed the Hyper Beam it was charging towards Blastoise, in the form of a massive black beam of pure destruction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before it could hit though, Blastoise was already moving, retreating into his shell and spinning out of the way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the same time Tyranitar slammed into the ground feet first over twenty feet away, hardly phased by the point blank Hydro Pump.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Or so it would seem.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a snarl, it slammed its fist into the ground and the mountain rumbled. Massive spires of rock erupted from where its fist impacted, travelling in a road towards Blastoise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blastoise could have easily dodged the Stone Edge with Aqua Jet. But, I didn't call for that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Instead a beam of red light washed over Beyblade Blastoise as I returned him to his gleaming black pokeball and quickly switched on the fly to another in less than a second.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Such was the utility of my new Rotom Gauntlet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's go, Snivy." I declared, releasing my second pokemon. It was time to test her out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I released her upwards, allowing her to materialize upon the top of one of the huge rocky spires elegantly, "Sunny Day, babe." I clicked my fingers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Snivy represented my bond with Hilda. And what better debut for my elegant little grass snake, than to down a Pseudo Legendary?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Snivy narrowed her eyes, not even missing a beat as her green snout upon her head raising in excitement as the heat intensified with a flash of light, and an orb of pure solar energy erupted from her body, shooting high into the air above and the clouded sky above us burned away in the span of mere seconds.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
All that was left was a blazing, harshly hot sun above us that the moment it was established, born from her power and lent its energy to her, "Solarbeam!" I ordered, "Right through the rocks, twist your head!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sni!" she cried out in confirmation, her little mouth stretching wide open like the serpent she was, and in all of a split moment, unleashed a golden beam of solar power multiple times the size of her body. It ploughed through the first few rocky spires in the blink of an eye, before she swept her head to the side-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The beam angled diagonally, sweeping through each of the rocky spires at different levels, and also sweeping across the length of the mountain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A roar of pain sounded out moments later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And as the debris cleared from the rocky spires being demolished, it was to show Tyranitar, half way towards me from the left - looking like it was planning to flank Blastoise initially - arms crossed over its face to protect itself, and arms simmering from where it most likely blocked the hit from Solarbeam.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It shook its arms out with a gruff huff and cocked its head, looking up at Snivy, and just stared for a moment. Then it raised a brow, and scoffed, shaking its head in amusement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"...Sni!?" an aggrieved spit shot from Snivy's little mouth, now back to normal as she glared at the Tyranitar, that just totally disregarded her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tyranitar smirked and lifted one clawed hand, and showed off two of its claws held a miniscule few centimetres apart. And then wiggled its claws mockingly at Snivy and laughed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Well that just wasn't nice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It didn't see Snivy as a threat at all because of her small size. Silly considering just a moment ago it had roared in pain from blocking her Solarbeam.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Oh well, it would come to regret that-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"SNIVY!" an angered shriek erupted from Snivy's mouth as she glared in fury down at the Tyranitar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And then her body exploded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Into glowing, blinding light.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
...Huh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before my eyes she began to grow and change. Her body doubled in size and length, stubby arms and legs elongated, a crest akin to a small crown appearing atop her head, and her spade-tail ballooning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
