If you wanna read ahead of my stories, you can check out the advanced chapters on my subcribestar, at the same username - 0Jordinio0}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 _____________________\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Not really, it's fine, I get it," I did laugh this time, "It's not like I blame you or anything, I wouldn't have been bragging about you if I did now would I? I just said it as it is."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well\u8230?that's good to hear I guess," she sighed, shoulders slumping, but smiling back nonetheless, "Still, did you have to say it all live like that? You realise people will be able to figure out who I am if they check your trainer profile right? Traded pokemon are still in the records and linked, so anyone checking your profile can easily follow it to mine."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh, I did not know that actually.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Something to keep in mind for later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eh, free advertisement," I replied cheekily, "Though, I remembered my promise, beyond talking on the camera I didn't let them interview me. My first time is reserved for you." I winked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"As charming as always aren't you?" Hilda snorted, before shaking her head, "Honestly Jord, I was joking when I told you not to get into trouble without me, but I think you took it as a challenge. How did you even find those fossil pokemon? Never mind two Dragonite?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Psychic powers." I shrugged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Time to start laying down that cover story. I can't go on forever just catching loads of rare and powerful pokemon without explanation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hilda blinked, "Wait\u8230?really!?" she sat up straighter, her fluffy chocolate hair bouncing, it made me remember how it felt in my hands, I wanted to run my fingers through it again, "You're a psychic?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Was," I 'corrected', "I wasn't born one or anything, but I came across these weirdo's a few months back before I came to Kanto. Dressed in these funky uniforms, all blue and white with stupid looking hoods. They had this psychic pokemon I'd never seen before, caged it up and had these weird devices that were stopping it from using its power. I set it free and its power that had been blocked off all exploded out of it, and a bunch of it seeped into me. I passed out, and when I came to the weirdo's and the psychic pokemon was gone, and I started getting visions for a while."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I clicked my fingers over the screen, "Learned to control them after a bit, used them to find out where a bunch of powerful and rare pokemon were," I continued, "They completely faded away a few weeks before I became a trainer, but I'd pretty much memorized everything I saw by that point. I suppose all that built up energy the pokemon let out was used up with the visions."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For a moment, Hilda just stared, "That\u8230?explains so much, here I was just thinking you were blessed by Arceus or the original dragon or something."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I am blessed though," I replied maturely, sticking out my tongue, "Blessed by the awesome that is being me. I mean, you should know well, you got to feel my blessing all night long."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Again, charming as ever Jord, that's what I love about you," she snorted, "Still\u8230?look\u8230?" she looked away, kind of awkwardly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
My eyebrows raised, interest forming, "Oh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She sighed, "\u8230?Rosa made things clear, so look," she turned back to face me on the screen, and gave me a smirk that would have looked more at home on my face, a cocky arrogant thing, It was kind of hot actually, "Leaving you hanging, wasn't fair. So for now, run wild as you please. But when I'm done with this nonsense over here and come back, I'm gonna lock your overly horny cocky arrogant ass down and put that ring on you, got it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Well, that\u8230?.I was not expecting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I felt the temptation to swoon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Or you know, I could just come back to Unova and help you, skip the middle man and you can get with the ringing right away," I smirked back at her, "Then we can break a few beds while I blow your back out."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hilda laughed, "Such a romantic aren't you? It's a wonder I'm not swooning right now," she replied, before shaking her head, "But no, now that I know about your visions, it makes it even more important I don't pull you away from all that. Don't worry, these idiots Team Plasma they're calling themselves, they're just idiots, nowhere near as threatening as Team Rocket or something, especially with Dragonite on my side. I'll deal with these idiots quick and help Rosa get her Eevee back, and then I'll come find you and before you know it, you'll be putting me through a bed frame and leaving an imprint of me in it." she winked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?That's hot." was all I could really say to that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I know right?" Hilda's smirk widened, "Still, that's all I wanted to say, and just wanted to check up on you. So I'm gonna go, it's too tempting to just say yes to your offers to have you come here. Love ya, bye."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And then before I could reply, she screen blipped out as she hung up on me.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?..Huh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh\u8230??\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh!?" I blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I looked up at the sky and nodded, "\u8230?.HUH!?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I didn't hear that wrong right?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, I didn't hear that wrong right?" I asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hear what wrong?" Rotom asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That last bit, she totally said 'love ya', right?" I asked, bobbing my head like a car bobble head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Correct, the human female known as Hilda White did indeed say those words." Rotom confirmed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I licked my lips, "Alright then," I nodded. Somehow, I'm feeling pretty good right now, better than good even. Motivated. Strong. Awesome. A little bit proud too, "Fuck it we ball team! Let's go catch a fucking legendary!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Oh Regice, buddy buddy buddy. You are not ready for the Jord train coming your way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Choo choo!" I pumped my fist, before jumping to my feet. With a word, a gleaming black luxury ball was in my hand and then I was sprinting forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And jumped straight off the mountain top, "Choo choo!" I cheered, releasing Pidgeot from the expensive ebony pokeball and landing atop his back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
