178: Chapter 177\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If you wanna read ahead of my stories, you can check out the advanced chapters on my subcribestar, at the same username - 0Jordinio0\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
____________________\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Yes, yes I wanted a shot at that. But\u8230?my mind drifted back to only a few hours ago, when Hilda called me.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She told me to go wild as I pleased with girls, but the next time she saw me, I was getting locked down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Considering Hilda was specifically back in Unova to help Rosa, well that route was closed off wasn't it?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because, the simple fact of the matter was, I wanted to lock in with Hilda. Because, beyond how gorgeous she was, beyond how amazing the sex had been with her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I really actually like Hilda.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So that was why, with a heavy heart and disappointed balls, I replied, 'No can do. Gorgeous as you are, and as amazing as it would be, the next time I see Hilda is when it gets serious.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I sighed as I sent the text rejecting her. It felt wrong to reject such a babe, but alas Hilda was worth the sacrifice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Oh, I know, who do you think made her lay it all out on the table?' was the reply I got from Rosa not long later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?What?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'You?' I replied, 'Why though? If you're interested, why make it harder by pushing Hilda to go for me harder?'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I was genuinely confused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'I didn't say I was gonna steal you now did I?' was her reply, alongside a smug smirking emoji, 'Come on now, a guy like you, are you going to turn down getting a second absurdly gorgeous hot beyond belief babe of a second girlfriend?'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was lucky I wasn't drinking anything or I'd have spat it all out over Aerodactyl's back. Dealing super effective damage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And probably making Aerodactyl fall out of the air, where we would crash hard into the ground and I would die gruesomely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Such was my shock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'\u8230?Explain.' I replied.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'What's to explain?' Rosa replied in practically the blink of an eye, 'A lot of girls are going to be after you now after your showing against Lance, and they won't care if you're in a relationship already or not. I'm surprised you haven't had gold diggers from all over swarming you with how blase you were about bedding girls and being single. I'm interested too, and I have the advantage. Hilda is the front runner, all I had to do was wear my silly cousin down into letting me take second place.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I stared blankly at the screen for a few moments. Surely not? There was no way Hilda would be fine with that\u8230?right?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?But then she did tell me I was free to go wild right, until I saw her again at least? That wasn't normal\u8230?.or was it normal here?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I mean Gary had a full cheerleader squad he was banging, and they seemed totally fine with it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I know the League was big on expanding the human populace, but polygamy?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I hadn't come across anything like that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'That sounds too good to be true.' I replied.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Well believe it buddy!' Rosa fired back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?I dunno.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Well, there was a simple way to check.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'And if I call Hilda right now, she'll tell me she's fine with this?' I replied once more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This time, it took a good few moments before Rosa replied, nearly a minute.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'\u8230?Don't do that. I might have jumped the gun a little and I'm still in the process of wearing her down, but it'll happen, trust me!' Rosa replied, 'You just have to say yes when I do. Don't act like you wouldn't want me and Hilda in your bed whenever you want, we both know you wanted to grab me by my twin tails and bend me over as soon as we saw each other on that video call a while back.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Well she wasn't wrong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But this conversation in of itself was dangerous if Hilda ever saw it and she was not amendable to it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, I need to lock it off right now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And do what any smart person would do in my position.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'\u8230?Take it up with Hilda. I'll leave it up to her.'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Delegate, delegate and delegate. Foist all responsibility on Hilda. The true path of a genius.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She replied a second later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a simple smirking confident looking emoji.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'=)'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Well alright then. That, I was not expecting at all. Can't say I'm not interested though in how that will turn out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ganbare Hilda.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Can't say I'm not hopeful she'll manage to convince Hilda either. I'm only a man after all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
_________________\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rosa looked up from her phone with a smirk, 'As expected, he was pretty easy to convince.' she thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not that she blamed Jord, what guy would say no in his position? It was smart of him though to side step any of the accountability by making her have to convince Hilda and refusing to commit himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She looked up from the phone, watching as Hilda scuffled around the bedroom getting ready for the day. They'd be heading out today to start cracking down on those goons from Team Plasma and start looking for her Eevee.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The cunts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her cousin hadn't even noticed her taking a picture of her fat ass as she got ready, to send to her beau.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The kid had wanted to fuck her no doubt, but locking him into a relationship when she barely knew him? That would be hard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Luckily, she had an in with Hilda who was already half in love with Jord, if not more so despite the way she denied it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She probably didn't even realise how often she scrolled through her pictures in her phone and stared at images of them together and sighed wistfully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It honestly made her feel guilty that because of her, Hilda had come back to Unova when she could be living it up with Jord and having a whirlwind crazy action packed romance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Fucking Team Plasma.' she cursed in her head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As it was though, she wanted him too. She wasn't in love with him, but that could come later. She liked his cocky shameless attitude though. And she absolutely adored his skill and ability as a trainer, he was amazing. And the casual way he gave away a Dragonite worth so much to Hilda, just to make sure she was safe?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What straight girl wouldn't swoon a little? You didn't get much greater in romantic gestures than that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The only thing that topped something like that, would be if he fought like\u8230?a rampaging legendary pokemon for her or something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So to put it bluntly, she wanted him. But she didn't want to take him from Hilda. As much as she loved teasing her and getting a rise out of her older cousin, she loved her dearly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So that left her with the option, of both of them getting with Jord. And she would make it happen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She'd yet to fail at achieving anything she truly put her mind to and this would go the same!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She just had to wear Hilda down. Take care of Team Plasma, save Eevee and then they could go together and lock Jord down with a pair of rings and rock his world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A perfect plan indeed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
_____________________\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
