185: Chapter 184\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If you wanna read ahead of my stories, you can check out the advanced chapters on my subcribestar, at the same username - 0Jordinio0\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
____________\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Jord, hey Jord!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I was met with quite the welcome sight when I made it to the main resort area of Porta Vista. The beach resort was filled with hundreds of people and pokemon spread throughout the vast beach area, food and item stalls, little restaurants and more lining the beach as far as the eye could see.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I'd barely sent a text letting them know I was in the area now to see them, before they were rushing over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Misty was the one who called out to me, and I turned to see her jogging over, my eyes instinctively roaming over her body appreciatively in the tiny little white bikini she wore that hugged her curves nicely, a yellow unzipped hoodie hanging from her shoulders.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Damn she looked good.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Truly an electric tale if there ever was one.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ash and Brock followed behind her, clad only in swim shorts, a massive grin was on Ash's face as met my eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Misty!" I grinned at her as she reached me, slowing to a stop and breathing a little heavily, which did amazing things to her scantly clad chest, "Looking great as always."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She grinned proudly, placing a hand proudly on her hip and cocking it proudly, "Don't I?" the orangette boasted, giving me a wink. Then she looked me up and down, taking in the pants I was wearing, alongside my boots and sleeveless hoodie, "You however are overdressed." she commented, just as Ash and Brock reached us.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pair of them shared a look as I smirked at Misty. I unzipped my hoodie, leaving my torso bare, Blissey sculpted god tier musculature in full view, "There, that better?" I teased as I tied it around my waist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No, you're still wearing pants." Misty only smirked back as her eyes roamed over my abs of Metagrossite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?No that didn't work.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Something to think on for later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well the day's still young," I laughed with a shrug, before turning to Ash and Brock, "Guys, great to see you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You too buddy!" Ash flashes me a thumbs up, Pikachu on his shoulder chirping a greeting to, "You've been on fire lately, we saw your battle against Lance, that was amazing!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That, and the video going viral about you wrestling with your pokemon, that was incredible as well," Brock shook his head smiling wryly, "A Gyarados and a Dragonite? That was crazy to see, just as shocking as that battle against Lance. And that Blastoise you caught didn't even want to attempt it after those two. That was impressive I have to admit Jord, absurdly dangerous and reckless and not at all how someone should deal with newly caught aggressive pokemon\u8230?but impressive nonetheless."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Misty met my eyes at the mention of Blastoise, brow raised, and I gave her a simple nod. Yes, it was the same one I told her about, and she simply nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It wasn't really the plan initially, I hadn't expected Gyarados to be that aggressive and I let Dragonite out after it by mistake, my hands were all bloodied and I fumbled," I shrugged and explained, "Still, what have you guys been up to recently? I've not seen you guys since Vermillion City, and well, Misty calling me to ask about that Riolu you caught to ask if I knew anything."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh yeah!" Ash snapped his fingers, "Thanks for that by the way, that was a massive help."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It was," Misty smiled, before shrugging herself, "And well, not much. After you left, we got into that mess with Riolu and Ash caught an Onix, which he evolved into a Steelix not long later with a metal coat."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And then we totally crushed Surge!" Ash boasted, pumping his fist with a grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"After he crushed you the first time you mean?" Misty snorted, making him stumble and laugh sheepishly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I looked to Brock who laughed, "He battled Surge one on one, Pikachu against Raichu, it was pretty close actually, but Pikachu lost in the end," the formed gym leader informed me, "He spent a few days putting Pikachu through some tough training for a re-match\u8230?had a little spat with a real piece of work, and then Ash had his rematch and managed to take down Surge's Raichu with Pikachu's newly learned Volt Tackle attack."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
My eyebrows raised, he knew Volt Tackle already? Pikachu wouldn't learn that originally until Battle Frontier when it was on the level of an Elite Four pokemon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Impressive," I nodded truthfully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thanks," Ash beamed, "Not as impressive as you taking on Lance of all people. But, I caught a Gengar as well while we were doing that training with Pikachu for our rematch and he's super tough! Next time we have a re-match Jord we won't lose!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It took considerable effort not to let my jaw drop a bit at the reveal Ash just dropped. Gengar?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And he had Riolu as well?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was it the same Gengar he got in the future? The one on his Journeys team? That meant he had picked up two of his World Monarch team.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Already?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Is this because of me? Or was he just always fated to come across these pokemon? This Ash was a lot farther ahead than the other ones for just starting out. As far as fully evolved pokemon he has, I know he also had a Beedrill, Butterfree, Venomoth, Scizor, Quagsizre, Ludicolo, Cloyster, Starmie and now both a Steelix and a Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
J-\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arceus man, if this Ash had been in the normal timeline where he started at ten, he would have dominated everything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unluckily for him though, this is not that timeline, and I am here.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's great, Gengar are amazing pokemon!" I praised him, before looking at Brock and Misty, "What about you two, catch anything new lately?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nah, the last I caught was Magikarp and Oddish at that pokemon village we visited on the way to Vermillion City," Misty shrugged with a roll of her eyes, "Not everyone is as catch crazy as you and Ash."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Same," Brock nodded in agreement with her, "The last I got were two from there as well, my Paras and Weepinbell."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I nodded, and honestly, thinking on it. Considering the helpful spores Paras could make and stuff? And that their mushrooms had medicinal properties and could be used to make powerful potions, Paras really did suit Brock as a pokemon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That said, "Magikarp, huh?" I smiled lightly at Misty, she had confessed to me way back on our date at Pewter, that even in this timeline she had feared Gyarados as a species.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She smiled back, "Gotta get over it sometime, right?" she simply shrugged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Good for her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To be quite honest, there was a few variations of Misty that varied between the timelines. The worst one of all, had been the other timeline Misty that travelled with Ash, the anime one, not the manga electric tales of Misty who was simply amazing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I had hated the anime timeline Misty. Not just because of her annoying attitude, but because of the sheer hypocrisy and self entitlement of her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Putting Togepi and everything else aside in their journey. The defining point in Ash's journey, where the idea originated for him to use new pokemon after Johto, came from Misty herself deriding him and constantly getting on his case\u8230?for using Charizard during Johto.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As if it was unfair for him to use a pokemon he had raised and trained already when challenged to a battle, against beginners or even gym leaders. As if using a pokemon he had raised to be strong instead of weak young ones\u8230?made him a worse trainer?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It came off as pure jealousy to me.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially because, immediately after leaving Ash she returned to the Cerulean City gym, and got her sisters strongest pokemon, their Gyarados. A Gyarados that was far far stronger than any of her own pokemon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And proceeded to basically barely ever use any of her own raised pokemon in battle again, only using the powerful Gyarados\u8230?raised by her sister.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After barely training her pokemon at all during the journey with Ash. And ended up getting mega evolution for Gyarados and everything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So yes, I had absolutely loathed that Misty.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Misty though, was an entirely different woman.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?It made me wonder if Iris in this world is more like her game or manga counterparts? Because those Iris' were amazing girls, while the anime timeline Iris was a trash heap in the same vein as that same timelines Misty.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Speaking of," I held my gauntlet clad fist up, and had Rotom spit out three Leaf Stones, "Here's the leaf stones I had for you guys."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, is that the new Silph Co storage tech?" Brock's eyes lit up as he accepted his stone first, "And in gauntlet form huh? That's an inspired choice I gotta admit. Thanks Jord."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That looks cool as hell, but yeah thanks Jord," Ash beamed, "Though I don't really have anything that evolves with a Leaf Stone like Brock's Weepinbell." he frowned before shrugging and beaming again, "Still good to have on hand though!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Considering how many pokemon you catch, it won't be long before you find one," Misty rolled her eyes, before smiling at me, "Thanks Jord, this'll be good for my Oddish when she evolves."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No prob," I shrugged waving it off, "Speaking of gifts though, is there anywhere we can make a trade around here? I've brought Wartortle with me."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Misty's eyes lit up, "Oh! There's a small pokemon centre not far from here where we can do it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How come Misty gets a free pokemon too?" Ash pouted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't you already have a Squirtle?" I raised a brow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well yeah, but what makes Misty special?" Ash shrugged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Boobs," Brock smirked, "She has them, you do-" he continued, only to double over as Misty buried an elbow in his gut.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh shut up you eternal virgin chud," Misty huffed and grabbed my elbow, "You two can go play in the sand, while I spend time with a real man."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey!" Ash glared pointing a scandalized finger, "What about me and Brock, are we chopped liver?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A real man." Misty smugly repeated, dealing critical damage as Ash huffed, and Brock's knees gave out beneath him in defeat, before dragging me off, arm nestled between her luscious cleavage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
_________________\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thanks for this," Misty said gratefully not long later as we stood within the trade room of the Pokemon Centre, Wartortle's gleaming black luxury ball in hand, a warm smile on her face, "I've always wanted a Blastoise you know?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well it would be weird for Misty, the future Kanto master of the Water Type to not have a Blastoise, right?" I grinned as I walked over to her, "I've got something else for you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her orange eyebrows rose as she looked up from the luxury ball, "More? You've just given me an evolutionary stone and a Wartortle, a pretty strong one at that considering the attacks it knows," she gave him a ludicrous look, sea-green eyes incredulous, before shaking her head in amusement, "Your sense of scale is all over the place you know? Between the stone and Wartortle, they would go enough for me to buy a decently big three bedroom house back in Cerulean you know?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Probably, considering how messed up the property rates and such were in this world. I still couldn't really wrap my head around it, and I've currently got a massive mansion home and place being built for me and my pokemon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I just shrugged, before holding my hand out, showing off a small dark blue scale, "What's this?" Misty asked, as she took it, "It's pretty." she noted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's a Dragon Scale," I told her, making her eyes go wide, one of the many I'd picked up on Dragonite Island, they were all over the place there. Considering the colours of the scale, it was probably from a Dragonair, "You'll probably want to catch a Horsea or Seadra at some point right? With this, you'll be able to evolve a Seadra into a Kingdra."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Misty stared at the dragon scale in her hand for a moment, before biting her lip and releasing a deep shuddering breath. She looked back up at me from it, "You're leaving Kanto tomorrow right?" she asked, stowing it and Wartortle's expensive black ball in her hoodie pocket.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah, there's things I need that I can't get in Kanto, I'll be back though." I assured her. There was one final stop I need to make, but honestly, it would just make my journey to Kalos quicker.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I'd originally planned on catching that Bulbasaur living in the sewers of Trovitopolis in the Orange Islands because it was way bigger than a normal Bulbasaur. But I'd been thinking on it the past few days.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That poor Bulbasaur has been living in a sewer for decades at this point. It wouldn't be in any real shape to train and become stronger. And while I don't really mind if not all my pokemon are interested in getting stronger, the situations with the Regi's made me think that perhaps I wasn't what that Bulbasaur needed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So instead, I'll tell Lance about it. And cut down my time in the Orange Islands to just going after the Crystal Onix and perhaps one of those giant Rhydon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And I'll go to the Bulbasaur secret garden and capture the Venusaur there instead. That thing was a beast anyway.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And perhaps if I did, it wouldn't get in the way of Ash's Bulbasaur evolving this time too, killing two Pidove with one stone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Misty nodded simply, before stepping close to me and throwing her arms around my neck, pressing soft pillowy breasts against my chest and smiling warmly at me, "I've got a separate room from Ash and Brock here for the next few days," she said softly, "Come up with me?" she asked, pecking me softly on the lips.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
My hands came down to settle on her warm, bare hips and squeezed the skin softly, making her mewl into me as I returned the kiss. Before pulling back and laying my forehead across hers, "Are you sure?" I asked, "I'm leaving soon, and the next time I see Hilda, things are probably going to get serious."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?I figured," Misty gave me a melancholy smile, bittersweet, "Thinking on it, as much as I enjoy travelling with Ash and Brock, I should have locked you down myself back in Pewter City after our date and asked to travel with you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She sighed, pushing her head a bit harder against mine, nuzzling her nose against mine, "I thought about it you know?" she told me, "But I chickened out. If I didn't, would it have changed things?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes," I told her bluntly, not hiding it at all, "Hilda is amazing, but so are you in your own way. If you had travelled with me, I'd have spent a lot of my time trying to get you like this, and then spend every night after that you travelled with me making you moan my name."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She chuckled, "\u8230?Just my own fault then for being a chicken," she pursed her lips before smirking, "Alright hot shot, then how about at least for tonight proving that little boast and come back to my room make me moan your name?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I laughed a bit, hands sliding from her lovely hips to cup her large soft toned ass cheeks, sinking my hands into her doughy cheeks and lifting her into the air by them. She gasped, giggling and long toned legs wrapped around my waist, "I'll do you one better," I grinned staring straight into her eyes as I held her up, "I'll make you scream it, all night long."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
