Huh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wait.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yeah.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
WHAT?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Rayquaza growled in pain and shakily planted both its arms in the sand and pushed its upper half up to glare at at Regice\u8230?or me?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its maw filled with flames, and I acted this time, surprise gone despite the absurdity of the situation I suddenly found myself in, "Regice, Ice Beam, again!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Regiiice!" it intoned, six golden eyes glowing brightly and unleashing another massive trio of icy beams from one of its arms, at the same time the Rayquaza unleashed a flamethrower.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?A flamethrower that couldn't compete with my Charizard's own for sure in heat, power or size.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I watched almost blankly as the Ice Beam and gout of flames met head on, clashing mid-air for a few moments, before the trio of icy jagged beams tore the flames asunder and continued on to pierce into the literal shiny legendary pokemon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And the Rayquaza, roared in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before falling limp in the sand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Regice blankly lowered its arm nonplussed, and I tilted my head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And stared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?What?" I whispered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
More shocked right now, more completely lost than the fucking day I woke up in this world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was just how absurd this situation was. A shiny Rayquaza, just there in a pokeball I'd randomly picked up after bumping into a random kid.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?A Rayquaza that was quite frankly, absurdly weak. I didn't even know it was possible for the lowest tier of legends to be this weak.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Never mind a Rayquaza.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I rubbed my eyes, before staring again. Nope, still there.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom\u8230?this isn't an illusion or something is it." I asked blankly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Negative, all scans indicate this is a truly honest Rayquaza. Shocking, very shocking," Rotom replied, "Capture it quickly before it recovers."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I don't think that'll be a problem." I distractedly replied, it was completely unconscious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Like yeah, it was four times weak to ice types attack and it was from Regice\u8230?but\u8230?but.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite took Regice's ice beams better!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the single sparring match Dragonite had fought against Regice so far, he'd taken three of them!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And an ancient power and zap cannon before going down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I slapped my cheeks roughly, forcing myself to focus, "Head in the game you fucking retard." I scolded myself, "Ball me Rotom."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Affirmative." Rotom replied, the slot on my palm opening up to deposite a shrunken luxury ball into my palm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I enlarged the gleaming expensive black, gold and red pokeball to full size, and couldn't help but laugh at the absurdity of it all, the pokeball was a match for Rayquaza completely in colour too!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A moment later, I tossed the ball and it bulleted through the air like a baseball, smacking into the downed shiny Rayquaza's head with a soft tink, before opening and to suck it inside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The luxury ball fell into the sand a second later as it closed, glowing red at the middle as it began to roll from side to side.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Twice..\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thrice\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tink!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rayquaza, was captured.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
