___________\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I held my gauntlet clad hand out, palm up, "Rotom." I said simply, no need for anything else, he already knew what to do.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One second, the palm of my gauntlet was empty, the second there was a sturdy large egg incubation container with a velvety cushion at the bottom, and sitting atop it?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A large stark grey egg.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"One Aerodactyl egg, that'll be a hundred million please." I cheekily grinned back at him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance's eyes widened as soon as the incubated egg came into view, his jaw dropping and for a moment he just stared, gaping at it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Droo." the huge dragonite behind him, warbled and gently pushed him from behind making the champion of both Kanto and Johto take a step closer to me.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He laughed a little shakily, before lifting his hands and gently, slowly, ever so gently took the egg from my grasp, "I can't believe It's really happened." Lance licked lips, before tearing his eyes away from the egg in his grasp, to grin happily at me, "A hundred million is a cheap price to pay for this, thank you Jord, truly."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He lowered the incubated egg down after staring at it a few more moments with awe and disbelief, happiness and more, before pressing a button on the red belt holding up his black and red bodysuit, and in a blink the egg disappeared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh, you've got storage tech in your belt?" I asked with interest. That, was actually a good idea, I hadn't thought of that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I prefer my gauntlet though.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Indeed, useful stuff isn't it?" he eyed my gauntlet knowingly, as he pressed a button on his belt, and pulled out a phone from it a moment later, "Not quite as imaginative as your way of doing things though, a rotom in a gauntlet. I might have to look into such a thing myself."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I've patented the idea." I jokingly smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His eyebrows rose, "Well, fair enough I suppose, a little greedy but a good idea on your part." Lance nodded approvingly, making me blink.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Wait, I actually could?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Something to do look into later then when I was travelling between regions of try hard bird back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He looked me up and down as he typed away on his phone, "You know Jord, you told me you've got quite a lot of shed skin from Dratini and Dragonair right?" he said, before pointing to himself, "You should think about getting some clothing made from it besides the boots, like my bodysuit. I don't want to tell you what to do, but considering you've got involved with legendary pokemon now, the danger has spiked up for you considerably. It would protect your body, the skin is highly resistant to most pokemon attacks and durable enough to block bullets, and or such projectiles."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Took a lot of bullets have you?" I asked, amused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A few," Lance shrugged and casually confirmed, making me blink, "Gun violence used to be a lot more prevalent when I was your age. But even now, you'll still find the odd pirate group who'll fire guns on you alongside attacking you with pokemon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Huh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, I'll look into it." I took his advice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance nodded in approval, before pressing a button on his phone, "There we go, that's the money transferred to you Jord." he said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And just as he finished saying so, Rotom beeped, "{\b
Confirmation of one hundred million pokedollars being deposited into your account Jord. Current balance: two hundred and thirty million, seven hundred and eighty three thousand, six hundred and eighty seven pokedollars}."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I swallowed at the massive number.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was so beautiful to hear. Was that the language of love? Was it developed in Kalos?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If I meet Serena should I get her to whisper such beautiful numerical worlds into my ears as sweet nothings?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thanks, pleasure doing business with you old Lancy boy." I laughed in delight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance snorted, "It was indeed," he nodded, before crossing his arms and raising an eyebrow at me, "So legendary pokemon huh? Regice, Regirock and Registeel. I have to admit, coming into possession of potent psychic power for a time or not, I'm impressed."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I snorted, "If you're impressed by that, wait until you see what I caught earlier, and this time it really was a complete accident and random encounter."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Something more impressive than three legendary pokemon?" Lance's second red brow joined the first, "Now I'm very curious."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You'll have to wait to see it on my profile, I'm keeping this guy a secret for now otherwise," I laughed, but\u8230?since he was here already, I'd love to battle him again, "How about a battle? You can meet Regice." I cast an excited grin at the towering Dragonite behind him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tempting, oh so tempting," Lance replied, "I would love to test the might of the legendary Regice, not just it, but Regirock and Registeel as well, it would be glorious\u8230?but no, as much as I would love to do it. Considering how much commotion we'd cause in such a battle, we'd have people pouring into the beach and crowding around us."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
