"..Saur\u8230?.?" it teetered on its legs, before yawning itself and slumping to the ground asleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Way to go little guy!" I thrust my hand out up towards the flower, and Togepi happily giggled, meeting me for a high five, before hopping on my shoulder.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
