"Togepri!" his eyes flashed with dark power as he thrust his little stubby arms out once more, and a translucent copy of himself erupted from his body, and speared straight inside the Venusaur's body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It groaned in pain, body spasming as the super effective attack enhanced by Nasty Plot devoured it from the inside out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And following that, a pitch black crackling orb of black power formed from my palm, and was unleashed, slamming into the back of the Venusaur's head and exploding.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
