"You little juggernaut you!" I gushed, nuzzling him back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Celebration aside, I cradled Togepi in the crook of my left arm, before opening my other hand up, "Rotom, luxury ball me."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A moment later, the shrunken form of a gleaming back luxury ball appeared in my palm. I pressed the golden middle of it, enlarging the ball, before kneeling down and tapping it to the back of the huge Venusaur's head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
